@* A page written as a template. The generator turns this file into the HomePage component. *@
<section>
    <h1>Hello, NetWasm.UI!</h1>
    <p>This app is C# compiled to a small WebAssembly module by NetWasm.</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Edit <code>Pages/HomePage.nwui</code> or <code>App.cs</code> and save: the dev server rebuilds and reloads.</li>
        <li>State lives in signals; only the DOM that reads a signal updates.</li>
    </ul>
</section>
